---
import { siteForms } from '../config/site';
const { review } = siteForms();
---
<section class="front-door" id="progress">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2>Keep learning after the episode.</h2>
      <p>Follow an idea from the show into useful reading and practical resources, connected to financial literacy, veteran initiatives and ending poverty.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="resource-grid">
      <article class="resource-card">
        <h3>From the conversation</h3>
        <p>Revisit a guest’s perspective, explore the question behind it and find resources selected to help you take the next step.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-red" href="/resources/">Explore episode resources</a>
      </article>
      <article class="resource-card">
        <h3>Free calls &amp; webinars</h3>
        <p>No public session is scheduled yet. When a topic, presenter and time are confirmed, details will appear on our events page.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/events/">See public event status</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-record">
      <h3>Progress record</h3>
      <p><time datetime="2026-11-16">November 16, 2026</time> · {review ? 'Local preview for review' : 'Resources connected to the show'}</p>
      <p>{review ? 'Episode-linked learning cards and a fillable bill-calendar worksheet are prepared for review.' : 'Explore episode-linked resources across our three mission areas, alongside a free bill-calendar worksheet.'} Programs remain in development. No program outcomes have been measured.</p>
      <p>Next: explore a conversation, follow a useful resource and <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">share a question</a> for a future episode or public session.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
